                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 2—Translation]<anchor n="55" xml:id="d294-f1"
                        /></seg>
                </opener>
                <p>To add to the Draft Convention as an introduction to paragraph six which begins
                    “Desiring etc.”</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>“With the purpose of making effective the Declaration drawn up by the Foreign
                        Ministers in this Second Meeting and desiring etc, etc.</p>
